+/*
+ * A zero-length INSTALL_FILTER_RULE request removes the tables installed by
+ * the previous data call.  Downstream performs the equivalent delete before
+ * it acknowledges the modem, so do this through the command pipe rather
+ * than merely forgetting the cached DMA buffers.
